            "ai_impact_text_bullet_ss": "SEBI issues its observations on draft IPO papers of Cult.fit and IGX on October 12, Observations on Sohan Lal Commodity, Eswari Global Metal issued on October 13, Cult.fit, Eswari Global Metal, IGX submit their draft papers in July 2026",
